@startuml state-order
title Biểu đồ trạng thái — Đơn hàng (Order)
[*] --> PENDING : POST /checkout\n(order.created, inventory.reserve)
PENDING --> AWAITING_PAYMENT : inventory.reserved\n[MOCK|VNPAY] / payment.request
PENDING --> CONFIRMED : inventory.reserved [COD]\n/ inventory.commit, order.confirmed
PENDING --> CANCELLED : inventory.reserve_failed\n(OUT_OF_STOCK)
AWAITING_PAYMENT --> CONFIRMED : payment.succeeded\n/ inventory.commit
AWAITING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED : payment.failed | inventory.expired\n| quá 15' (PAYMENT_TIMEOUT)\n/ inventory.release
PENDING --> CANCELLED : người mua huỷ
AWAITING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED : người mua huỷ
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : người mua huỷ\n/ payment.refund nếu đã trả
CONFIRMED --> SHIPPING : shipment.picked / in_transit\n(order.shipped)
SHIPPING --> DELIVERED : shipment.delivered\n(order.delivered)
DELIVERED --> COMPLETED : "Đã nhận" | sau 3 ngày\n(order.completed → ví seller, review)
DELIVERED --> RETURN_REQUESTED : trả hàng ≤ 7 ngày
RETURN_REQUESTED --> RETURNED : seller/admin duyệt\n/ payment.refund
RETURN_REQUESTED --> DELIVERED : từ chối
CANCELLED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]
RETURNED --> [*]
note right of CANCELLED : promotion nhả voucher shop + suất flash sale;\nvoucher sàn chỉ nhả khi lỗi toàn checkout
@enduml
